<title>CHINA: Hana Bank FRCD upped to US$90 mln.</title>
<headline>Hana Bank FRCD upped to US$90 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hana Bank's US$75 million floating-rate certificates of deposit issue has been increased to US$90 million after being oversubscribed, arrangers said.</p>
<p>They said the issue would be signed on July 25.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6321</p>
</text>
